WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.330
Before dawn, in cities across the
world, the same words begin the prayer:

2
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.240
God is greatest.

3
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.990
Five times a day,
Muslims wash, then stand,

4
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.980
bow and prostrate, in set words.

5
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.240
And wherever they are,
they all face one place:

6
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.280
the Ka'bah in Makkah.

7
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.990
With set times, set
words and one direction,

8
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.470
is there any room left for the heart?

9
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.670
In this mission, you'll walk
through preparing to pray,

10
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.770
and one cycle of set words and positions.

11
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:36.170
Then you'll explore other prayer, from
night prayer to personal requests,

12
00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:37.800
and the Friday prayer.

13
00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:42.450
Your mission: find out how fixed
prayer and the inner life fit together,

14
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.960
and where Muslims differ.
